### StackSpot

| Variável | Descrição | Padrão |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `CLIENT_ID` | Client ID | — |
| `CLIENT_KEY` | Client Key | — |
| `STACKSPOT_REALM` | Realm/Tenant | — |
