| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `CHATCLI_REMOTE_ADDR` | Remote server address (`host:port`), flag `--addr`. | `""` |
| `CHATCLI_REMOTE_TOKEN` | Bearer token (the server's shared token or a JWT), flag `--token`. | `""` |
