### Devin CLI (Cognition)

The DEVIN provider wraps the local `devin` binary — auth belongs to the CLI (`devin auth login`); see [Devin Provider](/features/devin-provider).

| Variable | Description | Default |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `DEVIN_MODEL` | Default model (slugs use dots, e.g. `claude-sonnet-4.6`) | `claude-sonnet-4.6` |
| `DEVIN_CLI_PATH` | Explicit path to the devin binary | `devin` from `PATH`, then well-known install dirs |
| `DEVIN_CLI_PERMISSION_MODE` | `--permission-mode` passed to the CLI | `auto` |
| `DEVIN_CLI_AGENT_CONFIG` | Declarative agent-config file for hardened tool lockdown | -- |
| `DEVIN_CLI_TIMEOUT` | Per-turn ceiling (Go duration) | `10m` |
| `DEVIN_CLI_SANDBOX` | Pass `--sandbox` (research preview) | `false` |
| `DEVIN_CLI_EXTRA_ARGS` | Extra CLI args (space separated) | -- |
| `DEVIN_CLI_RESPECT_WORKSPACE_TRUST` | Value for `--respect-workspace-trust`. Turns run in a throwaway temp dir the CLI cannot raise a trust prompt about, so the check is waived; `true` restores the CLI default | `false` |

For Agent mode to work well with some Ollama models that "think out loud" (Qwen3, Llama3...), keep `OLLAMA_FILTER_THINKING=true`.

### ZAI (Zhipu AI)

| Variable | Description | Default |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `ZAI_API_KEY` | API key (Bearer token or `id.secret` for JWT) | -- |
| `ZAI_MODEL` | Model to use | `glm-5` |
| `ZAI_MAX_TOKENS` | Response token limit | `50000` |
