| `ZAI_USE_CODING_PLAN` | `true` points the provider at the GLM Coding Plan (subscription) endpoint `https://api.z.ai/api/coding/paas/v4/chat/completions`. Same platform API key; usage is covered by the plan and `/cost` reports it at $0 | `false` |
