StackSpot's agent API decides the output limit **server-side** (it ignores `max_tokens` in the payload). ChatCLI's catalog assumes a **128K** context window for StackSpot agents — previously the generic 50K fallback made auto-compact fire on almost every turn. If your agent's foundation model has a different window, tune it with [`CHATCLI_CONTEXT_WINDOW`](#history-compaction-and-payload-recovery).

