### Tool result microcompaction

Applied to the session history to shrink old tool results. See also [Tool Result Management](/features/tool-result-management).

| Variable | Description | Default |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `CHATCLI_MICROCOMPACT_TRUNCATE_TURNS` | After how many turns old tool results become head+tail previews. | `2` |
