## Scheduler

See [Scheduler (Chronos)](/features/scheduler) for the full design. All boolean variables accept `enabled`/`disabled`/`true`/`false`/`1`/`0`.

### Core

| Variable | Description | Default |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `CHATCLI_SCHEDULER_ENABLED` | Master switch | `true` |
