| Variable | Description | Default |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `CHATCLI_GRPC_REFLECTION` | `true` registers gRPC server reflection on `chatcli server` (it exposes the service schema — development only). It is also the default of the `--enable-reflection` flag, so setting the variable alone is enough; the flag without the variable does not enable it. The server chart's `server.grpcReflection` and the Instance's `spec.server.security.enableReflection` set it. Reflection calls need the server credential like any other RPC. | `false` |
| `CHATCLI_AUTO_UPDATE` | Auto-update policy: `auto` (silent background staging), `notify` (update hint on the welcome screen and in-session) or `off` | `notify` |
